# --- Build-context security ------------------------------------------------
# Nothing below is needed to build or run the image. Without these lines a
# build from the repository root sends them to Docker, and `COPY . .` puts
# them into image layers.

# Every .env file holds live credentials.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Claude Code workspace: skills, local settings, and the run-jarvis driver's
# logs, screenshots and database backups.
.claude/

# Database dumps and backups, wherever they land. The Prisma migrations are
# the only SQL the image needs, so they are re-included explicitly.
**/*.sql
!packages/db/prisma/migrations/*/migration.sql
**/*.dump
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.bak
**/*.backup
**/backups/
**/*.bundle

# Local logs can contain request data.
**/*.log

# The host's Turborepo cache (5 GB locally). The image builds from source.
**/.turbo
